        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n  subgraph Client\n    U[User]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Infrastructure\n    LB[Load Balancer]\n    AG[API Gateway]\n    RL[Rate Limiter]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Services\n    US[URL Shortener Service]\n    AS[Analytics Service]\n    BJ[Background Jobs]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Storage\n    RD[(Redis Cache)]\n    DB[(SQL Database)]\n    ADB[(Analytics DB)]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Async\n    MQ[Message Queue - Kafka]\n  end\n\n  U --&gt; LB --&gt; AG --&gt; RL --&gt; US\n\n  US --&gt; V{Valid URL?}\n  V -- No --&gt; Err[400 Bad Request]\n  V -- Yes --&gt; EX{Check Existing?}\n  EX -- Yes --&gt; Ret[Return Existing]\n  EX -- No --&gt; Gen[Generate Unique ID]\n  Gen --&gt; B62[Base62 Encode]\n  B62 --&gt; Store[Store in Redis &amp; SQL]\n  Store --&gt; Ret\n\n  US --&gt; GET{GET /{code}}\n  GET --&gt; Cache{Redis Hit?}\n  Cache -- Yes --&gt; Redir[301/302 Redirect]\n  Cache -- No --&gt; DBQ[Query SQL DB]\n  DBQ --&gt; Found{Found?}\n  Found -- No --&gt; NF[404 Not Found]\n  Found -- Yes --&gt; Upd[Update Redis]\n  Upd --&gt; Redir\n\n  Redir --&gt;|Async Event| MQ\n  MQ --&gt; AS\n  AS --&gt; ADB\n  BJ --&gt;|Cleanup| DB\n  DB -.-&gt;|Replication| DB_Repl[(SQL Replica)]\n\n  style RD fill:#f9f,stroke:#333\n  style DB fill:#ddd,stroke:#333\n  style ADB fill:#ddd,stroke:#333\n  style MQ fill:#ff9,stroke:#333\n  style US fill:#bbf,stroke:#333\n  style AS fill:#bbf,stroke:#333\n  style BJ fill:#bfb,stroke:#333\n  style V fill:#fff4dd,stroke:#d4a017\n  style EX fill:#fff4dd,stroke:#d4a017\n  style Cache fill:#fff4dd,stroke:#d4a017\n  style Found fill:#fff4dd,stroke:#d4a017\n  style Err fill:#fdd,stroke:#a00\n  style NF fill:#fdd,stroke:#a00&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="rGpDVouqmUU8EX-uOjbe-27">
